{
  "abstract": "Support and separator constraints for indecomposable graphical-zonotope summands, planar classification, and exact dimension spectra for 3-trees and partial 3-trees, with lattice attainment and intrinsic incidence forests. Includes tree-join and three-hub book dimension formulas, Hamiltonian 3-tree lattice witnesses, and K5-free graphs with full-dimensional indecomposable lattice weak summands but no admissible spanning 3-tree.",
